bai (0.4.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add local OpenAI-compatible chat provider support.
  * Generalize provider configuration with BAI_API_TYPE, BAI_BASE_URL,
    BAI_API_KEY, and BAI_MODEL.
  * Reject deprecated provider-specific model/base settings with migration
    errors.

